%%body
{
  Wrenching the maintenance panel with your Abyssal-Iron crowbar granted you access to the cube of a structure.

  Trotting along happily through the narrow pathways, Nori had been quiet, more than likely doing his usual scans.

  Arriving in what appeared to be the maintenance room, you throw yourself in the chair to catch your breath.

    @ Nori "This facility is indeed without power, several power plants used to power the facilities, but they have all shutdown, no surprises there."

  Absolutely none, but it sounded like you weren't in the right place to begin with.

    @ Nori "No, we are in the right place, I was able to uplift the coordinates to the power plant that powered this location."

  That was good news, but... what good was that going to do you?

    @ Nori "A quick visit and investigation should give us a better picture, and maybe find us what we need."

  You could get behind that, but first, you'd like to explore the floor.

    @ Nori "Oh certainly, I agree, we can investigate the accessible parts of the mine, it may have useful materials."

  May.

}
%date 2026-07-31, 2026-08-04
